{"data":{"id":"J1hvsgkTyuY","slug":"the-stuyvesants","title":"The Stuyvesants","artwork":null,"tracks":[{"id":"BBuru8LqWBY","slug":"one-thing-the-stuyvesants-remix","title":"One Thing (The Stuyvesants Remix)"},{"id":"U8tQACOit1k","slug":"yearning-for-your-love","title":"Yearning (For Your Love)"},{"id":"mZWGB02hsZE","slug":"the-second-time-around","title":"The Second Time Around"},{"id":"5jFVZq_O824","slug":"future-groove","title":"Future Groove"},{"id":"M4H8hzp3q2Q","slug":"walk-it-off","title":"Walk It Off"},{"id":"I_w7J8-QO5Y","slug":"steelo-the-stuyvesants-remix","title":"Steelo (The Stuyvesants Remix)"},{"id":"EyxE2XmRvs8","slug":"her-9000","title":"Her 9000"},{"id":"y2T8rann2DU","slug":"05-all-the-good-times","title":"05 All The Good Times"}]},"markers":[{"id":"FzVYgX27yfQ","position":45,"timestamp":"01:22:56","rawTrack":"The Stuyvesants - Steelo (The Stuyvesants Remix)","track":{"id":"I_w7J8-QO5Y","path":"/artists/the-stuyvesants/tracks/steelo-the-stuyvesants-remix/","slug":"steelo-the-stuyvesants-remix","title":"Steelo (The Stuyvesants Remix)","artist":{"slug":"the-stuyvesants","title":"The Stuyvesants"},"artwork":null},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"ymbEftQiGo8","slug":"all-day-2020","tags":[19],"links":{},"state":"published","title":"Soulection All Day 2020","artwork":"/images/episodes/soulection-all-day-2020.jpg","content":"\n**🎊🌟 Happy New Year 2020 🌟🎊**\n\nA day of exclusive mixes from [Joe Kay's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#joe-kays-set), [Sasha Marie](/episodes/all-day-2020/#sasha-maries-set), [Budgie](/episodes/all-day-2020/#budgies-set), and [Skinny Macho](/episodes/all-day-2020/#skinny-machos-set) to bring in the new decade. \n<!--more-->\n\n#### Jump to:\n\n- [Joe Kay's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#joe-kays-set)\n- [Sasha Marie's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#sasha-maries-set)\n- [Budgie's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#budgies-set)\n- [Skinny Macho's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#skinny-machos-set)\n\nAlso listen to [Soulection All Day 2019](/episodes/all-day-2019/).\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2020-01-01T14:41:45+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"n5l0ZMU7D-Y","position":34,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"The Stuyvesants - One Thing (The Stuyvesants Remix)","track":{"id":"BBuru8LqWBY","path":"/artists/the-stuyvesants/tracks/one-thing-the-stuyvesants-remix/","slug":"one-thing-the-stuyvesants-remix","title":"One Thing (The Stuyvesants Remix)","artist":{"slug":"the-stuyvesants","title":"The Stuyvesants"},"artwork":"images/artists/the-stuyvesants/tracks/one-thing-the-stuyvesants-remix.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"vPfL7UzxY4Y","slug":"139","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-139-w-dj"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #139 w/ DJ Harrison","artwork":"/images/episodes/139.jpg","content":"DJ Harrison thows down a crazy live improvised session with the SP-404 and MPC1000\n\n<!--more-->\n\noe Kay started off with some nice deep/melodic tracks from Mr. Carmack, Christoph El Truento, Dirg Gerner, Iamnobodi, Sango, Last Night In Paris, Geode and many more! Joe took it back to the essence with Ginuwine/Timbaland/Dilla classics! DJ Harrison on the other hand who reminds us of Madlib (no really he does)all the way from Virginia threw down a crazy live session with the SP-404 & MPC 1000. Lots of soulful chops and intricate drum patterns! This is another amazing session from start to finish! Spread this if you feel it.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10810,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-03T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"sBNueY3pGuM","position":15,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"The Stuyvesants - Yearning (For Your Love)","track":{"id":"U8tQACOit1k","path":"/artists/the-stuyvesants/tracks/yearning-for-your-love/","slug":"yearning-for-your-love","title":"Yearning (For Your Love)","artist":{"slug":"the-stuyvesants","title":"The Stuyvesants"},"artwork":"images/artists/the-stuyvesants/tracks/yearning-for-your-love.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"-M58cuvh5dI","slug":"143","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-143"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #143","artwork":"/images/episodes/143.jpg","content":"Joe Kay focuses playing dropping just over 100 tracks in 3 hours \n\n<!--more-->\n\nIt's been about 3 months or more since there has been no guest on Soulection Radio. \nIt's been an amazing journey of having so many different personalities roll through the station and educate us with their production, selections, knowledge, and experiences. \nThis week Joe Kay wanted to let loose and focus strictly on his selection. Within 3 hours Joe dropped just over 100 tracks, that's right over 100! \n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10796,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-31T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"fearhBStPFQ","position":13,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"The Stuyvesants - Yearning (For Your Love)","track":{"id":"U8tQACOit1k","path":"/artists/the-stuyvesants/tracks/yearning-for-your-love/","slug":"yearning-for-your-love","title":"Yearning (For Your Love)","artist":{"slug":"the-stuyvesants","title":"The Stuyvesants"},"artwork":"images/artists/the-stuyvesants/tracks/yearning-for-your-love.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"5Xbl7MTHePo","slug":"172","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-172-w-rhettmatic-beat-junkies"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #172 w/ Rhettmatic (Beat Junkies)","artwork":"/images/episodes/172.jpg","content":"Rhettmatic of the legendary beat Junkies Crew graces us with a 50 minute set + an in depth interview. \n\n<!--more-->\n\nRhett is definitely one of the most humble guests we've had on here and is more connected than anyone really knows. Do yourself a favor and get mentally prepared to learn a lot. It's much more than just music. Shouts to Rhettmatic, Mr. Choc, J. Rocc, and the rest of the Beat Junkies crew. Also, big big up to Free The Robots for coming through the studio and vibing with us. Much love to you & the whole Crosby crew. Stay tuned for much more to come. Enjoy.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10880,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-04-26T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay’s Session","position":0}},{"id":"XA7S7oCvA3U","position":5,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"The Stuyvesants - The Second Time Around","track":{"id":"mZWGB02hsZE","path":"/artists/the-stuyvesants/tracks/the-second-time-around/","slug":"the-second-time-around","title":"The Second Time Around","artist":{"slug":"the-stuyvesants","title":"The Stuyvesants"},"artwork":"images/artists/the-stuyvesants/tracks/the-second-time-around.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"laWaR2BCPmc","slug":"185","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-185-w-fortune"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #185 w/ Fortune","artwork":"/images/episodes/185.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10764,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-08-30T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"u4mgszXomnY","position":5,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"The Stuyvesants - The Second Time Around","track":{"id":"mZWGB02hsZE","path":"/artists/the-stuyvesants/tracks/the-second-time-around/","slug":"the-second-time-around","title":"The Second Time Around","artist":{"slug":"the-stuyvesants","title":"The Stuyvesants"},"artwork":"images/artists/the-stuyvesants/tracks/the-second-time-around.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"laWaR2BCPmc","slug":"185","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-185-w-fortune"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #185 w/ Fortune","artwork":"/images/episodes/185.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10764,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-08-30T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"-LkEg7OjaPw","position":15,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"The Stuyvesants - Future Groove","track":{"id":"5jFVZq_O824","path":"/artists/the-stuyvesants/tracks/future-groove/","slug":"future-groove","title":"Future Groove","artist":{"slug":"the-stuyvesants","title":"The Stuyvesants"},"artwork":"images/artists/the-stuyvesants/tracks/future-groove.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"t26W25WELwY","slug":"190","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-190-w-esta"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #190 w/ Esta","artwork":"/images/episodes/190.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10834,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-10-26T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"5HHT0YVLVZo","position":12,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"The Stuyvesants - The Second Time Around","track":{"id":"mZWGB02hsZE","path":"/artists/the-stuyvesants/tracks/the-second-time-around/","slug":"the-second-time-around","title":"The Second Time Around","artist":{"slug":"the-stuyvesants","title":"The Stuyvesants"},"artwork":"images/artists/the-stuyvesants/tracks/the-second-time-around.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"HYh1pKyFzn0","slug":"191","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-191-w-mr-carmack"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #191 w/ Mr. Carmack","artwork":"/images/episodes/191.jpg","content":"It's been long over due but we were finally able to get Carmack one on one. \n<!--more-->\n\nHe is definitely one of the most forward thinking artists of the new generation. If you produce then there is a good chance that you know who Carmack is. He has inspired many all over the world and has pretty much created his own genre of sound. How many times have you heard another producer make a beat similar to his and say to yourself, \"CARMACK\"!?\n\nThis guy has been a big part of Soulection's growth and history and it felt good to finally sit down with my bro to talk about his growth and current inspirations. We talked about how his move to L.A. changed his life, how he feels about other producers who create music that sounds like his, his relationship with drugs and why he calls his music drugs, when we can expect the next album, and much more.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10740,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-11-01T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Interview with Mr. Carmack","position":3}},{"id":"SrfZAcaZ_ko","position":4,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"The Stuyvesants - Walk It Off","track":{"id":"M4H8hzp3q2Q","path":"/artists/the-stuyvesants/tracks/walk-it-off/","slug":"walk-it-off","title":"Walk It Off","artist":{"slug":"the-stuyvesants","title":"The Stuyvesants"},"artwork":"images/artists/the-stuyvesants/tracks/walk-it-off.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"w4gYRLgk3zs","slug":"193","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-193-w-sosupersam-hannah-faith-yukibeb-kronika-eden-hagos"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #193 w/ SoSuperSam, Hannah Faith, Sasha Marie, Yukibeb, Kronika, & Eden","artwork":"/images/episodes/193.jpg","content":"\n<!--more--